>
>Quick question:  I want to set the options 'number_pad'
>'rest_on_space' and 'showexp' when I start the game up without
>re-typing them each time, and can't understand what the docs mean when
>they mention the 'NETHACKOPTIONS' command/file/line/whatever.  Any
>help out there?
>
Well, the Unix thing to do is to create a file called '.nethackrc'
with the following line in it:

OPTIONS=rest_on_space,showexp,number_pad

If you really want to feel proud of yourself, you can throw in
showscore as well.

